{"id":277,"date":"2021-01-08T16:36:05","date_gmt":"2021-01-08T22:36:05","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/chartsandstories.com\/?p=222"},"modified":"2021-04-28T13:49:13","modified_gmt":"2021-04-28T18:49:13","slug":"my-3-timeless-setups-that-have-made-me-tens-of-millions","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/my-3-timeless-setups-that-have-made-me-tens-of-millions\/","title":{"rendered":"3 TIMELESS setups that have made me TENS OF MILLIONS!"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"277\" class=\"elementor elementor-277\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-256c55d elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"256c55d\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-129692d\" data-id=\"129692d\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c54145e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c54145e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>I have made tens of millions the past few years trading 3 simple, timeless setups. These setups occured last year, 10 years ago, 50 years ago and 100+ years ago. They occur over and over again. They occur in the Japanese market, they occur in the Swedish market, they occur in the Indian market. The U.S. stock markets are the biggest and baddest of them all and therefore the best hunting grounds if you have a setup with an edge.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c8d7083 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c8d7083\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>These 3 setups are:<\/p><ul><li>Breakouts (if you want to learn this setup this is a mandatory video: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=xx8GvtAxilk&amp;feature=youtu.be&amp;t=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=xx8GvtAxilk&amp;feature=youtu.be&amp;t=1<\/a><br \/>Note: that\u2019s one of my moderator Youtube channel, not mine)<\/li><li>The Episodic Pivot (EP)<\/li><li>The Parabolic short (or long)<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b05f4f7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b05f4f7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Before I go into detail about where to buy, lock in profits, position sizing and stopping out of a losing trade, I want to talk a little about position sizing and risk.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eb58292 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"eb58292\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>I don\u2019t believe you should ever have more than 30% of your account over night in any stock or ETF. Intraday you can do more since you don\u2019t have to deal with potential over night gaps.<br \/>Most of my positions are 10-20% of account size.<br \/>My risk on most trades is usually 0.25-1%. I rarely risk more than 1% of my account on any trade.<br \/>When my accounts were small, less than a few million, I risked more, maybe 0.5-1.5%.<br \/>At the very beginning I risked more still, but honestly I had not a great grasp of the concept risk and position sizing in the beginning.<\/p><p>Okay, let\u2019s get to the setups!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ba01a1c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ba01a1c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Breakouts<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9788358 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9788358\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you study thousands of the biggest winning stocks over the past 100 years they tend to move in stair steps. Meaning they will make a 20-50%+ move, pull back and go sideways for a while, then make another move. This is how most leading stocks act.<br \/>This pattern is something we as traders can use to our advantage, to get an edge.<br \/>How to find these setups?<br \/>Scan for the 1 or 2% of stocks that are up the most over these 3 timeframes<br \/>1-month<br \/>3-month<br \/>6-month<br \/>This is how you find the stocks that are leading right now.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1528907 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1528907\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">There are 3 steps to this setup:<\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-70bf5be elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"70bf5be\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol><li>A big move higher sometime in the past 1-3 months. This move can be anywhere from 30-100%+ and usually lasts a few days to a few weeks.<\/li><li>An orderly pullback and consolidation with higher lows and tightening range in the consolidation phase.<\/li><li>A range expansion (breakout) out of that consolidation. The consolidation phase is usually 2 weeks to 2 months. During the consolidation the stock price \u201csurfs\u201d the rising 10- and 20-day. and sometimes toe 50-day moving average.<\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e6526f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e6526f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How do you trade this setup?\n\n<\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a758306 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a758306\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol><li>Identify the setups. You need to have a watchlist ready before the market open. You should also probably have alerts set, and know how many shares you want to buy.<\/li><li>Enter on the opening range highs. The opening range highs can be the highs of the first 1-minute candle, the 5-minute candle or the 60-minute candle (on the 60-minute timeframe the first candle is always only 30 minutes, 9.30-10 AM). You can use whatever timeframe or a combination of them. You don\u2019t even have to use any intraday chart, just look at the daily chart and enter when the stock is starting to break out.<br \/>This method can also be traded by anticipating the breakout but I don\u2019t find it as effective and more skill and experience is needed.<\/li><li>Stop is always lows of the day and stop should not be wider than the ATR or ADR of the stock, to prevent the risk\/reward mechanics getting out of whack. So if the ADR of the stock is 5%, your stop shouldn\u2019t be wider than 5%. If the ATR if 50c, then stop should not be wider than 50c.<\/li><li>You should sell 1\/3 to 1\/2 of the position after 3-5 days, and then move the stop to break even. The rest of the position should be trailed with the 10- or the 20-day moving average. Depends on how fast the stock is. If a beginner stick to the 10-day. You wait for the first CLOSE below the 10- day.<\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-675bd24 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"675bd24\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In a bullish market it is very common to get moves that are 10-20x+ your initial risk if you are good at setup selection.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-214c97c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"214c97c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>There are variations of this setup but the premise stays the same.<br \/>I am a swing trader and use the daily chart to find these setups, but this setups also works on the weekly chart and the intraday (1- and 5-minute) charts. On the intraday timeframe this setup is called Holy Grail by some on the daily it can be called a hight tight flags sometimes. It\u2019s pretty much flat channels, symmertrical and descending triangles. I\u2019ve even drawn the lines to illustrate this on 2 of the examples below.<br \/>I am providing 3 examples of breakout setups with 5-10 years between them.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff87ef7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ff87ef7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>$TSLA from 2020 before and after:<\/h4><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/ZLgLmkUB.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-111\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/ZLgLmkUB-949x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"712\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/ZLgLmkUB-949x1024.png 949w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/ZLgLmkUB-278x300.png 278w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/ZLgLmkUB-768x829.png 768w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/ZLgLmkUB.png 1186w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\" \/><\/a><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/bkCDS4f6.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-110\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/bkCDS4f6-949x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"712\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/bkCDS4f6-949x1024.png 949w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/bkCDS4f6-278x300.png 278w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/bkCDS4f6-768x829.png 768w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/bkCDS4f6.png 1186w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a36b4cf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a36b4cf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>$MNKD from 2013, before and after:<\/h4><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-4.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-113\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"502\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-4.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-4-300x147.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-4-768x377.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-5.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-112\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"502\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-5.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-5-300x147.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-5-768x377.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d0a1031 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d0a1031\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>$AAXN ($TASR) from 2004), before and after:<\/h4><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/XwCsHEYv.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-117\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/XwCsHEYv-949x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"712\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/XwCsHEYv-949x1024.png 949w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/XwCsHEYv-278x300.png 278w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/XwCsHEYv-768x829.png 768w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/XwCsHEYv.png 1186w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\" \/><\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/kgRf6Eci.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-118\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/kgRf6Eci-949x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"712\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/kgRf6Eci-949x1024.png 949w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/kgRf6Eci-278x300.png 278w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/kgRf6Eci-768x829.png 768w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/kgRf6Eci.png 1186w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ed404f3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ed404f3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you look closely, there are additional setups on these stocks.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9717575 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9717575\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Episodic Pivot (EP)<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-339eea9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"339eea9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>When unexpected good news hits a stock, especially if that stock is neglected, that can trigger multi-month, and multi-year moves.<\/p><p>There are many types of EPs:<br \/>Earnings and earnings guidance<br \/>Government regulations, political stuff<br \/>Biotech related like drug trial results or FDA decisions<br \/>Macro and political related<br \/>\u2026and many more!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-20295b0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"20295b0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The main ones I focus on are earnings and earnings guidance. When a stock reports unexpected good earnings and guidance, that is often a catalyst for a big and prolonged move.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1e387a1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1e387a1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Let\u2019s take a look at $NVDA from 2016 and 2017.<br \/>Look at what happened at the leftmost red arrow. The stock gapped up on big earnings numbers and a big beat to analyst expectations. A big surprise. Look at the volume, it ended up having several times average volume that day. Look at the move it made over the next few months.<br \/>Now the middle red arrow, the stock gapped up slightly but sold off. This is not an EP. The earnings were big, the analyst beat was big but this didn\u2019t matter.<br \/>An EP needs to be a gap of 10%+ and big volume should be there, if not in pre-market then the first 5-10 minutes after the open.<br \/>Look at the last red arrow. The stock had essentially been going sidewats for 4 months and had another huge quarter, with EPS and Revenues growing 126% and 48% respectively. Another big beat with EPS of 85c vs analyst expectations of 67c.<br \/>Scroll down to see what happened next.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-526240d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"526240d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>$NVDA in 2016 and 2017:<\/h4><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-6.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-122\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-6-940x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"719\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-6-940x1024.png 940w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-6-275x300.png 275w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-6-768x836.png 768w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-6.png 1110w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\" \/><\/a><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-9.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-123\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-9-940x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"719\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-9-940x1024.png 940w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-9-275x300.png 275w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-9-768x836.png 768w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-9.png 1111w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\" \/><\/a><\/p><p>That earnings report started a move that lasted 6 months and where the stock almost doubled.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3ac816e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3ac816e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The next one is $FSLR in 2007. I don\u2019t have the exact numbers on that earnings report as I did the work on it 10 years after it happened but the earnings and revenue were close to triple-digit, if not triple-digit. Look at that gap up and volume.<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-10.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-127\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"496\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-10.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-10-300x145.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-10-768x372.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-11.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-128\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"493\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-11.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-11-300x144.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-11-768x370.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9012cff elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9012cff\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Same thing with $BB ($BBRY) in 2004.<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-12.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-129\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"451\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-12.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-12-300x132.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-12-768x338.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-13.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-130\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"451\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-13.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-13-300x132.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/image-13-768x338.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1981276 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1981276\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Learn this setup, it takes 4-8 earnings seasons (1-2 years) to get good at this setup and understand it.<br \/>Once you learn it, you need to do very little work to find these. You literally let them come to you.<br \/>Create your own sell rules. You can trail these with the 20- or 50-day moving average, or whatever you find to work the best.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8b85d80 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8b85d80\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The steps to this setup are:\n\n<\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c09582a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c09582a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol><li>Gap up 10%+<\/li><li>Big volume. If the volume is not there in premarket, it needs to come in at the open. Many times the best ones have traded their average daily volume in the first 15-30 minutes after the open.<\/li><li>If an earnings or earnings guidance related EP, there has to be big growth numbers, preferably mid\/high or even triple digit EPS and revenue growth and a significant beat to analyst expectations. Many times the smaller stocks don\u2019t have analyst coverage, you just have to trust the numbers and volume.<\/li><li>It\u2019s best if the stock has not rallied over the past 3-6 months. If the stock has already made a big, multi month move into the gap-up, is it really a surprise to the market? It\u2019s your job to figure it out!<br \/>Happy hunting!<\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-92ea49b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"92ea49b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How do you trade this setup?<\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5acdaa1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5acdaa1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol><li>Identify the setup, this can usually be done in after-hours or pre-market as we are looking for stocks gapping up on news\/earnings.<\/li><li>Enter opening range highs. ORH can be the highs of the first 1-, 5-, or 60-minute candle. The stop is at the lows of the day.<\/li><li>Trail your stop with the 10- or 20-day moving average once they surpass your initial stop.<\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1dc5e5a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1dc5e5a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The Parabolic Short (or long)\n<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e47c2d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7e47c2d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Think of stocks as rubber bands, if they get really stretched short term, they can have powerful snapbacks. This is by far the riskiest setup if done wrong or if you have issues with not obeying your stops.<br \/>Most of these are short setups, but sometimes there are also good long setups but they don\u2019t occur as often.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0e4797a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0e4797a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">These are the steps for this setup:<\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-663c7c2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"663c7c2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol><li>A stock up 50-100%+ in a few days or weeks (if larger cap) or 300-1000%+ (if smaller cap).<\/li><li>The stock should be up 3-5+ days in a row. Many times you have examples where a stock trends higher for weeks or months and then starts speeding up, some just explode from nowhere.<\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5e133c6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5e133c6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How do you trade this setup?\n<\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-81ab197 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"81ab197\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol><li>When you think you have identified a candidate you can short on the opening range lows (1-minute, 5-minute candles). You can wait for the first red 5-minute candle in case the stock goes straight up from the open. You can wait for the stock to have the first crack, bounce back into VWAP (the only intraday indicator I really use) and if it fails at VWAP you can enter (or add). The fail could be the first red 1- or 5-minute candle into the VWAP. The stop is highs of the day or if VWAP fail, a reclaim of the VWAP. The key is to get relatively tight and defined stops.<\/li><li>The target area is the 10- and 20-day moving averages, that\u2019s where these stocks usually bounce.<\/li><li>Don\u2019t be too early. WAIT for the right setup. Let the amateur shorts get run over, that\u2019s where your edge comes in.<\/li><li>This setups is not like the Breakout or the EP where you can sometimes get a 30-50x+ risk reward on your trade. This setup is more like 5-10x risk reward, but if you wait for the perfect setups your win rate is probably going to be higher.<\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-327237d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"327237d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>$LAZR in 2020, daily and 5-min intraday:<\/h4><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/mDdMfHVX.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-141\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/mDdMfHVX-1024x583.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"376\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/mDdMfHVX-1024x583.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/mDdMfHVX-300x171.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/mDdMfHVX-768x437.png 768w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/mDdMfHVX-1536x874.png 1536w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/mDdMfHVX-2048x1165.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\" \/><\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/1Kw1KLL7.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-140\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/1Kw1KLL7-949x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"712\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/1Kw1KLL7-949x1024.png 949w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/1Kw1KLL7-278x300.png 278w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/1Kw1KLL7-768x829.png 768w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/1Kw1KLL7.png 1186w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\" \/><\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/hvJky3zs.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-142\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/hvJky3zs-1024x583.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"376\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/hvJky3zs-1024x583.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/hvJky3zs-300x171.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/hvJky3zs-768x437.png 768w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/hvJky3zs-1536x874.png 1536w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/hvJky3zs-2048x1165.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\" \/><\/a><\/p><h4>\u00a0<\/h4>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-78925b9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"78925b9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>$AIG in 2009, daily and 5-min intraday:<\/h4><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig1.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-150\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig1-1024x583.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"376\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig1-1024x583.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig1-300x171.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig1-768x437.png 768w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig1-1536x874.png 1536w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig1-2048x1165.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\" \/><\/a><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig2.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-152\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"487\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig2.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig2-300x143.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig2-768x365.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig3.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-151\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig3-1024x583.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"376\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig3-1024x583.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig3-300x171.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig3-768x437.png 768w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig3-1536x874.png 1536w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/aig3-2048x1165.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f14b5b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f14b5b7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>$AMTD in 1999 daily and 5-min intraday:<\/h4><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/amtd1.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-156\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/amtd1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"491\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/amtd1.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/amtd1-300x144.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/amtd1-768x368.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/amtd2.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-157\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/amtd2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"486\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/amtd2.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/amtd2-300x142.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/amtd2-768x365.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-451edd9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"451edd9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Let\u2019s take a look at a parabolic long setup. These are not very common but any time a successful parabolic short goes down 50-60%+ in a few days, that\u2019s the premise for the long setup. Entry is opening range highs or the first green 5-minute candle or any range break to the upside if the stock doesn\u2019t rally out of the gate, which they usually do. These things can bounce 50-100% in a few days.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5719b9c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5719b9c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>$GBTC in 2017, daily and 5-min intraday:<\/h4><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/gbtc1.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-159\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/gbtc1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"730\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/gbtc1.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/gbtc1-300x214.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/gbtc1-768x548.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/gbtc2.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-158\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/gbtc2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"395\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/gbtc2.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/gbtc2-300x116.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/gbtc2-768x296.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/gbtc3.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-160\" src=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/gbtc3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"721\" srcset=\"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/gbtc3.png 1024w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/gbtc3-300x211.png 300w, https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/gbtc3-768x541.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5b90f49 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5b90f49\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>All of my setups are about finding low risk entries on fast moving stocks. It\u2019s all about finding tight, high probability areas 